IMPORT prelude

-- National Insurance Law [Consolidated Version], 5755-1995 (חוק הביטוח הלאומי), ss 1, 334, 337
-- and Schedule J. THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every other module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../registers/source-bundle/national-insurance-law-consolidated-version-5755-1995.he.wiki.txt,
-- Hebrew Wikisource raw MediaWiki, retrieved 2026-10-06, sha256 78bf47ee...2a97. An unofficial
-- consolidation of the text as amended at retrieval. A `src:N` comment quotes line N of that
-- file, generated by tools/srcquote.py; nothing in Hebrew here is typed by hand.
--
-- Money is new Israeli shekels (NIS), as a bare NUMBER.
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact,
-- or a register, a return or an employer's records hold it. Whether the fact makes contributions
-- payable, and at what rate, is a rule, and belongs in the module of the provision that says so.

§ `Nouns for sections 1, 334 and 337 and Schedule J`

§§ `The branches of insurance`

-- Schedule J, column B ("ענף ביטוח"), names the branch of each item; s 335 imposes contributions
-- branch by branch. Nine branches, in the order Schedule J prints them. Items 1 and 2 are both
-- the maternity branch: item 2 is "maternity – an insured person who is neither an employee nor
-- self-employed", and that distinction lives in the columns, so it is not a tenth branch here.
-- src:4720 | 1. | אימהות | 1.40 | 0.94 | – | 0.24 | 0.37 | – | 0.87 | 0.10 | 0.09 |
-- src:4721 | 2. | אימהות – מבוטח שאינו עובד ואינו עובד עצמאי | – | – | 0.16 | – | – | 0.16 | – | – | – |
-- src:4722 | 3. | ילדים | 2.08 | 2.74 | 1.67 | 1.68 | 0.92 | 1.65 | – | – | 0.08 |
-- src:4723 | 4. | נפגעי עבודה | 1.96 [note: (הוראת שעה בשנים 2024 עד 2027: 2.06)] | 0.78 | – | 0.60 | 0.26 | – | – | – | 0.03 |
-- src:4724 | 5. | נפגעי תאונות | 0.13 | 0.09 | 0.07 | 0.04 | 0.05 | 0.06 | 0.07 | 0.03 | 0.02 |
-- src:4725 | 6. | אבטלה | 0.33 | – | – | 0.06 | – | – | 0.21 | 0.02 | 0.06 |
-- src:4726 | 7. | זכויות עובדים בהליכי חדלות פירעון | 0.04 | – | – | 0.01 | – | – | – | – | 0.02 |
-- src:4727 | 8. | נכות | 2.28 | 2.12 | 1.31 | 0.62 | 0.73 | 1.31 | 1.86 | 0.29 | 0.10 |
-- src:4728 | 9. | סיעוד | 0.28 | 0.21 | 0.14 | 0.08 | 0.08 | 0.14 | 0.14 | 0.03 | 0.02 |
-- src:4729 | 10. | אזרחים ותיקים ושאירים | 5.89 | 5.95 | 3.65 | 2.22 | 2.06 | 3.60 | 1.52 | 0.57 | 0.25 |
DECLARE `A branch of insurance` IS ONE OF
    `maternity`
    `children`
    `work injury`
    `accident injury`
    `unemployment`
    `employees' rights in insolvency proceedings`
    `disability`
    `long-term care`
    `senior citizens and survivors`

§§ `The columns of insured persons in Schedule J`

-- Column C of Schedule J is split three ways, by who the insured person is:
-- src:4719 | לעובד | לעובד עצמאי | למבוטח שאינו עובד ואינו עובד עצמאי | לעובד | לעובד עצמאי | למבוטח שאינו עובד ואינו עובד עצמאי |
-- Which of the three a person is follows from the s 1 definitions of "employee" and
-- "self-employed person" (encoded in nii-s1-definitions.l4) and from s 335 (not in this row).
DECLARE `A column of insured persons in Schedule J` IS ONE OF
    `an employee`
    `a self-employed person`
    `an insured person who is neither an employee nor self-employed`

-- Column C's other split: the part of the income above the reduced collection threshold, and
-- the part not above it.
-- src:4718 | על חלק העולה על מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת כהגדרתה בסעיף 334(א) | על החלק שאינו עולה על מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת כהגדרתה בסעיף 334(א) | על חלק השכר העולה על 60% מהשכר הממוצע | על חלק השכר שאינו עולה על מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת כהגדרתה בסעיף 334(א) |
DECLARE `A part of the income` IS ONE OF
    `the part above the reduced collection threshold`
    `the part not above the reduced collection threshold`

§§ `A row of Schedule J`

-- One item of Schedule J, every column as the schedule prints it. The figures are percentages,
-- as the column heading says ("אחוזים"), stored as printed (1.40 means 1.40%). A cell printed
-- "–" is NOTHING: the schedule gives no figure there, which is not the same as a figure of 0.
--
-- Column letters follow the schedule's own (טור א׳ to טור ה׳ are columns A to E):
--   A  the item number (פרט)
--   B  the branch of insurance
--   C  "percentages of the income or the wage under sections 337(a) and 340(a)": six cells,
--      above / not above the reduced collection threshold × employee / self-employed / neither
--   D  "the deduction from the employee's wage for section 342(c), in percentages": two cells,
--      on the upper part of the wage / on the part not above the reduced collection threshold.
--      Where the upper part begins differs between the two versions of the schedule
--      (nii-schedule-j.l4 says how); its use is s 342(c), row IL-05.
--   E  "the allocation of the State Treasury under section 32(c1)": one cell; s 32 is not in
--      this row.
DECLARE `A row of Schedule J` HAS
    `item`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `branch`                                        IS A `A branch of insurance`
    `C above the threshold, employee`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `C above the threshold, self-employed`          IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `C above the threshold, neither`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `C not above the threshold, employee`           IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `C not above the threshold, self-employed`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `C not above the threshold, neither`            IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `D on the upper part of the wage`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `D on the part of the wage not above the threshold` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `E Treasury allocation`                         IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- The totals row ("סך הכל") that closes each table, in the same nine figure columns. Every cell
-- of both totals rows prints a figure, so these are plain NUMBERs.
DECLARE `The totals row of Schedule J` HAS
    `C above the threshold, employee`               IS A NUMBER
    `C above the threshold, self-employed`          IS A NUMBER
    `C above the threshold, neither`                IS A NUMBER
    `C not above the threshold, employee`           IS A NUMBER
    `C not above the threshold, self-employed`      IS A NUMBER
    `C not above the threshold, neither`            IS A NUMBER
    `D on the upper part of the wage`               IS A NUMBER
    `D on the part of the wage not above the threshold` IS A NUMBER
    `E Treasury allocation`                         IS A NUMBER

-- The nine figure columns, by name, so that a rule (or a test of a totals row) can speak of one
-- column at a time. Same order as the fields above.
DECLARE `A figure column of Schedule J` IS ONE OF
    `column C, above the threshold, employee`
    `column C, above the threshold, self-employed`
    `column C, above the threshold, neither`
    `column C, not above the threshold, employee`
    `column C, not above the threshold, self-employed`
    `column C, not above the threshold, neither`
    `column D, upper part of the wage`
    `column D, part of the wage not above the threshold`
    `column E`

-- A version of Schedule J, as read for a given year: its ten items and its totals row, and where
-- column D's upper part begins.
DECLARE `A version of Schedule J` HAS
    `name`                                          IS A STRING
    `rows`                                          IS A LIST OF `A row of Schedule J`
    `totals`                                        IS A `The totals row of Schedule J`
    `column D upper part begins above 60% of the average wage` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `A person who works, for the definition of "employee"`

-- s 1 "עובד" includes a family member who works for a relative without an employment
-- relationship, on conditions; s 1 "מעביד" is one who employs a person within an employment
-- relationship; s 334(b) adds, for Chapter 15, a person whose wage is fixed by a Law or a Knesset
-- resolution. Each limb is a fact an employer's records, a contract or the enactment shows.
-- src:172 | ”מעביד“, ”מעסיק“ – מי שמעסיק אדם במסגרת יחסי עבודה;
-- src:204 | ”עובד“ – לרבות בן משפחה, אף אם אין בינו לבין קרובו המעסיקו יחסי עבודה, ובלבד שהוא עובד במפעל באופן סדיר ובעבודה שאילולא עשה אותה הוא, היתה נעשית בידי עובד; לענין זה, ”בן משפחה“ – אחד ההורים, ילד, נכד, אח או אחות;
-- src:3608 | (ב) לענין פרק זה רואים כעובד גם את מי ששכרו נקבע בחוק או בהחלטת הכנסת או על פיה, ואת החייב בתשלום השכר רואים כמעבידו.
-- INPUT CONVENTIONS:
-- * `employed within an employment relationship` is the labour-law question whether the
--   relationship is one of employment. It is decided under the general law, not in this Law,
--   and a court or the Institute records the answer; this row takes it as a fact.
-- * `a parent, child, grandchild, brother or sister of the relative employing them` is the
--   closed list s 1 gives for "בן משפחה" in this definition.
DECLARE `A person who works` HAS
    `employed within an employment relationship`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `a parent, child, grandchild, brother or sister of the relative employing them` IS A BOOLEAN
    `works in the enterprise regularly`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `in work which, had they not done it, would have been done by an employee` IS A BOOLEAN
    `wage fixed in a Law or in or under a resolution of the Knesset`      IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `A person's occupation in a period, for the definition of "self-employed person"`

-- s 1 "עובד עצמאי", for a tax year or part of one, tests an occupation followed not as an
-- employee by average weekly hours and average monthly income. The averages are computed under
-- the Minister's regulations (5745-1985), which are not in this row: the averages are inputs.
-- src:206 | ”עובד עצמאי“, לענין שנת מס פלונית או חלק ממנה – מי שעסק באותה תקופה במשלח ידו שלא כעובד (להלן – משלח יד), והתקיים בו אחד מאלה:
-- src:207 | (1) הוא עסק במשלח ידו, לפחות עשרים שעות בשבוע בממוצע;
-- src:208 | (2) הכנסתו החודשית הממוצעת ממשלח ידו לא פחתה מסכום השווה ל־50% מהשכר הממוצע;
-- src:209 | (3) הוא עסק במשלח ידו לפחות שתים עשרה שעות בשבוע בממוצע והכנסתו החודשית הממוצעת ממשלח ידו לא פחתה מסכום כאמור בלוח א׳;
-- src:210 | לענין הגדרה זו רשאי השר לקבוע שיטת חישוב של ממוצעים וכן שיעור אחר במקום השיעור הקבוע בלוח א׳;
DECLARE `A person's occupation in a period` HAS
    `engaged in the period in an occupation not as an employee`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `average hours a week in the occupation`                               IS A NUMBER
    `average monthly income from the occupation`                           IS A NUMBER

§§ `The data for an update of the average wage`

-- s 1 "השכר הממוצע" is computed from figures the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) publishes and
-- from the rate of any cost-of-living compensation. Both are published facts: inputs.
-- src:222 | ”השכר הממוצע“ – הצירוף של שניים אלה:
-- src:223 | (1) הממוצע החודשי של השכר הממוצע למשרת שכיר בשלושת החודשים האחרונים שלגביהם היו נתונים בידי הלשכה המרכזית לסטטיסטיקה ביום שקדם ליום העדכון (להלן בהגדרה זו – ממוצע השכר);
-- src:224 | (2) תוספת לממוצע השכר בשיעור הפיצוי שניתן בתקופה שמתום שלושת החודשים ששימשו בסיס לחישוב ממוצע השכר ועד ליום העדכון;
-- src:225 | לענין הגדרה זו, ”יום העדכון“ – 1 בינואר של כל שנת מס, ואם חל פיצוי לאחר מכן – 1 בחודש שבו חל הפיצוי; על כל שינוי בשכר הממוצע יפרסם השר הודעה ברשומות;
-- The three months are "the last three months for which the CBS had data on the day before the
-- update day", oldest first. The compensation rate is a fraction (2% is 0.02): s 1 "שיעור הפיצוי"
-- is the rate by which wages rose as a result of the compensation, which the agreement and the
-- Minister's notice record.
DECLARE `The data for an update of the average wage` HAS
    `CBS average wage per employee post, first of the three months`                IS A NUMBER
    `CBS average wage per employee post, second of the three months`               IS A NUMBER
    `CBS average wage per employee post, third of the three months`                IS A NUMBER
    `compensation rate given from the end of those three months to the update day` IS A NUMBER

§§ `An employee's month of contributions`

-- The case for s 337(a)(1). INPUT CONVENTIONS, each because the rule that settles it is outside
-- this row:
-- * `calendar year of the month` is the year of the month FOR which contributions are paid
--   (Schedule J's sub-heading: "rates for April 2011 onward"); it selects the version of the
--   schedule and the reduced collection threshold.
-- * `branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`: s 335 says, branch by
--   branch, for whom contributions are paid (a non-resident employee pays maternity only, a
--   controlling shareholder in a closely-held company no unemployment, and so on). s 335 is
--   not in this row; its answer is an input.
-- * `monthly income on which contributions are computed` is the employee's monthly income as
--   the provisions outside this row make it: what counts as income, and the maximum and minimum
--   (s 348 and Schedule K, row IL-05; and the sections around them). It is not negative.
-- * `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income`: s 341 lets the
--   Minister, "notwithstanding sections 337 and 340", set reduced rates by order for part of an
--   insured person's income (an order of 5759-1999 is noted at source line 3656). Neither s 341
--   nor the order is in this row; whether an order reaches this income is a fact the Institute's
--   records hold, and where one does the s 337 rules decline.
-- * `the employer pays reduced work-injury contributions under section 343`: s 343 lets the
--   Minister allow an employer of at least 500 employees to pay reduced work-injury contributions.
--   Not in this row either; where it applies and work injury is among the branches, s 337(a)(1)
--   declines.
-- src:3655 | על אף הוראות סעיפים 337 ו־340 רשאי השר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, לקבוע בצו שיעורים מופחתים של דמי ביטוח לגבי חלק מהכנסתו של מבוטח שהוא עובד עצמאי או שהוא עובד או של מבוטח שאינו עובד ואינו עובד עצמאי, או להחיל שיעורים מופחתים על הכנסה של מבוטח כאמור שלא תעלה על סכום שיקבע בצו; הוראות לפי סעיף זה, שהיו בתוקף לפני יום א׳ בטבת התשס״ו (1 בינואר 2006) לענין קביעת סכום השכר או ההכנסה שאינם עולים על מחצית השכר הממוצע, יחולו לענין קביעת סכום השכר או ההכנסה שאינם עולים על מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת.
-- src:3678 | השר רשאי לקבוע כי מעביד שאישר לכך ישלם דמי ביטוח מופחתים לענין סעיף 340 כפי שיקבע, ובלבד שנתמלאו בו תנאים אלה:
DECLARE `An employee's month of contributions` HAS
    `calendar year of the month`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`      IS A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
    `monthly income on which contributions are computed`                  IS A NUMBER
    `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employer pays reduced work-injury contributions under section 343` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Another insured person's year of contributions`

-- The case for s 337(a)(2): "another insured person" is anyone who is not an employee, so the
-- Schedule J column is the self-employed column or the neither column, and the type says so: an
-- employee cannot be put in this record (s 337(a)(1) is the employee's rule).
DECLARE `The Schedule J column of an insured person who is not an employee` IS ONE OF
    `the self-employed column`
    `the column for an insured person who is neither an employee nor self-employed`

-- INPUT CONVENTIONS as for the employee's month (s 343 concerns employers only), and:
-- * `annual income on which contributions are computed` is the annual income as the provisions
--   outside this row make it (with their minimum, maximum and exemptions applied).
-- * `number of periods set for paying advances` is how many periods the year is divided into
--   for advance payments; those periods are set outside this row (s 336 makes the payment period
--   a month unless the Minister sets otherwise).
DECLARE `Another insured person's year of contributions` HAS
    `calendar year`                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `column`                                                              IS A `The Schedule J column of an insured person who is not an employee`
    `branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`      IS A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
    `annual income on which contributions are computed`                   IS A NUMBER
    `number of periods set for paying advances`                           IS A NUMBER
    `reduced rates under an order made under section 341 apply to this income` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `An order changing the rates in Schedule J`

-- s 337(b): the Minister may change the rates by order, with the approval of the Knesset Finance
-- Committee; for the insolvency branch after consulting the Minister of Finance, for long-term
-- care with the Minister of Finance's consent. Each limb is a fact the order or its record shows.
-- src:3628 | (ב) השר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, רשאי לשנות בצו את שיעורי דמי הביטוח האמורים בלוח י׳, ואולם שינוי שיעורי דמי הביטוח לענין זכויות עובדים בהליכי חדלות פירעון ייעשה לאחר התייעצות עם שר האוצר, ולענין ביטוח סיעוד – בהסכמת שר האוצר.
DECLARE `An order changing the rates in Schedule J` HAS
    `made by the Minister`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the Finance Committee of the Knesset`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `branches whose rates it changes`                                     IS A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
    `made after consultation with the Minister of Finance`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `made with the consent of the Minister of Finance`                    IS A BOOLEAN
